	"Description": "This mod uses Realtime Framework, meaning the changes only take place leading up to, and on, Halloween.\u00A0 If you're downloading this in April hoping to make spirits eve festival more interesting, sorry.\n<br />\n<br />A chill is in the air.\u00A0 There's a new TV channel, and it's reporting on spooky changes in the valley.\n<br />\n<br />Watch TV, investigate the news, find candy, and give it out on Halloween to make lots of friends.\n<br />\n<br />There's several different news stories to look into, and different ways to come across candy across the valley.\u00A0 But be warned, villagers only love candy on Halloween day, so make sure not to hoard it too long.",
